&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assemblies are now digitally signed using cosign.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4637" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4637/hovercard"&gt;#4637&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed &lt;code&gt;NullReferenceException&lt;/code&gt; in the metrics filter when a job's definition&lt;br&gt;
cannot be resolved.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4731" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/pull/4731/hovercard"&gt;#4731&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-dotnet-contrib/blob/Instrumentation.Hangfire-1.16.0-beta.2/src/OpenTelemetry.Instrumentation.Hangfire/CHANGELOG.md"&gt;CHANGELOG&lt;/a&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;
